{"about":"Parts registry for cultivation characters, round 4 (2026-10-31-cultivation-parts-3, from his note on cult-parts-look-2; round 3 was from cult-parts-look-1). A character is a mix of keys: {gender, build, skin, height, bust, direction, outfit}. Every key resolves here; garments.js runs each piece's recipe against the posed body, so any mix is a parameter change, not a redraw. Cards: council/parts/<piece>.md. Keys follow the passport look spec in council/callsheets/calrunia-creator.md (cr-one-look, cr-first-menu). Street outfits A3, B3, C3 (2026-11-21, Wendell on rs2-ch1-route-stills-look-2: 'The arcade needs a different outfit for the real world'): a hip-length top over trousers and trainers, so the Arcade's visitors do not wear the sect's robe.","genders":{"m":{"piece":"body-ubc-regular-male","file":"regm","source":"Quaternius Universal Base Characters (Source kit, bought 2026-10-25), Regular_Male_FullBody, CC0"},"f":{"piece":"body-ubc-regular-female","file":"regf","source":"Quaternius Universal Base Characters (Source kit, bought 2026-10-25), Regular_Female_FullBody, CC0"}},"builds":{"slight":{"piece":"build-slight","toward":{"m":"teenm","f":"teenf"},"t":0.7},"average":{"piece":"build-average"},"broad":{"piece":"build-broad","toward":{"m":"ubcm","f":"ubcf"},"t":0.5}},"skins":{"piece":"skin-ramp","ramp":["#e9c9ae","#dfb595","#cf9f7c","#bb8763","#a46f4e","#8a593d","#6d4430","#513224"]},"hemUnit":"hem is the hem height above the sole as a fraction of stature","height":{"piece":"stature","min":1.5,"max":1.95,"default":1.75,"unit":"m, crown to sole, uniform scale"},"forearm":{"piece":"forearm-girth","default":0.72,"ramp":[0.1,0.35,1.0,-0.1],"unit":"girth factor about the elbow-to-wrist line: ramps in from ramp[3] (just above the elbow) to ramp[0], full to ramp[1], back to 1 at ramp[2] (the wrist); a parts default, not a player slider yet"},"shoulder":{"piece":"shoulder-slope","girth":0.74,"full":0.4,"out":0.85,"lower":0.02,"unit":"girth factor on upper-arm skin